Dear {!YGSF_Contract__c.Legal_Reviewer__c},

A new contract has been assigned to you for legal review.

Contract Details:
- Contract Number: {!YGSF_Contract__c.Name}
- Contract Title: {!YGSF_Contract__c.Contract_Title__c}
- Contract Type: {!YGSF_Contract__c.Contract_Type__c}
- Contract Subject: {!YGSF_Contract__c.Contract_Subject__c}
- Contract Value: {!YGSF_Contract__c.Contract_Value__c}
- Staff Liaison: {!YGSF_Contract__c.Staff_Liaison__c}
- Location: {!YGSF_Contract__c.Location__c}
- Submission Date: {!YGSF_Contract__c.Submission_Date__c}

Please review the contract and associated documents at your earliest convenience. The SLA review period begins from the submission date.

Thank you,
YGSF Contract Management
